sequenceDiagram
    participant DP as Data Principal
    participant API as Consent API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant KMS as Signing KMS
    participant PR as Downstream Processor

    DP->>API: GET /notices/{purpose_id}?lang=ta
    API->>DB: SELECT notice_translation WHERE lang='ta'
    DB-->>API: content, content_hash, translator_sig
    API-->>DP: Notice bundle (Tamil) + content_hash
    Note over API,DB: audit_event: NOTICE_SHOWN

    DP->>API: POST /consents {purpose_id, notice_version_id, content_hash}
    API->>API: Verify content_hash matches stored version
    API->>KMS: Sign consent receipt (principal, purpose, notice, ts)
    KMS-->>API: Ed25519 signature
    API->>DB: INSERT consent_record, consent_audit_event (GRANT)
    API-->>DP: 201 Created + signed receipt

    Note over API: Purpose-bound processing proceeds
    API->>DB: INSERT consent_audit_event (VIEW) on each data access

    DP->>API: DELETE /consents/{consent_id}
    API->>DB: UPDATE status='withdrawn', INSERT audit_event (WITHDRAW)
    API->>PR: POST /erasure {principal_pseudonym, purpose_id}
    PR-->>API: 202 Accepted
    API->>DB: INSERT processor_fanout, audit_event (ERASURE_FANOUT)
    PR->>API: POST /erasure/ack {fanout_id}
    API->>DB: UPDATE erasure_confirmed_at, audit_event (ERASURE_CONFIRMED)
